    {
      "text": "Thou shalt speak all that I command thee, Ex. 7:2. Lord commanded Moses in mount Sinai, Lev. 7:38. What thing soever I command you, observe to do it, Deut. 12:32. ye shall command your children to observe to do, Deut. 32:46. As the Lord commanded Moses … so did Moses command Joshua, Josh. 11:15. I have commanded the ravens to feed thee, 1 Kgs. 17:4. for he commanded, and they were created, Ps. 148:5. the heavens, and all their host have I commanded, Isa. 45:12. whatsoever I command thee thou shalt speak, Jer. 1:7.",
